`bisellium ready` + `bisellium done` -> state: done, committed; then ONE MORE
commit "feat: more work, never certified". merge run from the trunk.

  bisellium merge W-001 --studio studio --repo .
    "opus/W-001's tree no longer matches its certificate — opus W-001's gate
     "tests" certifies tree:22d520cb..., which no longer matches its current
